### 7. Create Order - Conflict Error (409 Conflict)
POST {{host}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{orderId}}",
  "customerName": "Jane Duplicate",
  "customerEmail": "jane.duplicate@example.com",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "deliveryAddress": {
    "name": "Jane Duplicate",
    "telephone": "+34-91-123-4567",
    "street": "123 Gran Via",
    "complement": "Apt 4B",
    "city": "Madrid",
    "state": "Madrid",
    "zipCode": "28013",
    "country": "Spain"
  },
  "invoiceAddress": {
    "name": "Jane Duplicate",
    "vatNumber": "ES12345678Z",
    "telephone": "+34-91-123-4567",
    "street": "123 Gran Via",
    "complement": "Apt 4B",
    "city": "Madrid",
    "state": "Madrid",
    "zipCode": "28013",
    "country": "Spain"
  },
  "orderLines": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPriceInCents": 12999
    }
  ]
}

### 8. Retrieve Non-Existent Order (404 Not Found)
GET {{host}}/v1/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### 9. Cancel / Delete Order (204 No Content)
DELETE {{host}}/v1/orders/{{orderId}}

### 10. Update Order - Non-Existent Product Error (400 Bad Request)
